        source      "author-set box for this exercise: the base of an elevated flare drawn by eye; not a flare design.  The NORMAL load is the run's own: the three gas streams that leave the plant for treatment -- Purge 89.0 + LetdownGas 126.7 + FlashGas 531.6 = 747 kg/h (0.21 kg/s), ammonia-bearing and hydrogen-rich.  The EMERGENCY relief load, which sizes a real flare, is NOT computed here";
